5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to get started! I want to see who we can actually get on board for these teams. I'll look into Retained recruiters' placement times and Adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,"I believe we need a clearer picture of our actual performance. I will look into the Profile of the exits and the write-off, as well as Account retention through price rises.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm feeling lucky today! But let's be smart about our cash. I'll check the Reserve accounts and follow-on calls, and the Terms of last winter's credit line. Let's see where we actually stand.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know how we handle the numbers! I'll look into Independent checks on holdings' reported figures and Appraisal needs at the last audit. I hope they aren't too scary!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to understand why our deployments have been lagging. I'll look into the Security review time before first deployment and the Delivery records of two holdings to identify potential bottlenecks.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Does anyone else think we should check the delivery records? @Mizuki is on it, but I'm curious if that'll overlap with the recruiter data. I think we've covered the main bases for now!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,George,,"I think we have a comprehensive spread. @Mio, the recruiter data is more about human capital, while delivery records are about operational execution. They are different, but both are vital for a seed-stage company's survival.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, you're always so serious! But you're right. I'm just making sure we don't run out of steam—or cash—halfway through. I'm curious to see if our credit line is as friendly as they claimed.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'm just wondering if the numbers will be easy to read! @Mizuki, do you think the security reviews take a long time because the companies are messy, or because we are just being super careful?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, it could be either. I suspect the nature of the customer's data might be the real trigger. I'll let you know if the records show a pattern based on the industry.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm really looking forward to seeing if our advisers are actually available to help! It would be a shame to pick a great company and then have no one to guide them.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,George,,"I agree, @Mio. Guidance is essential. I am particularly interested to see if our past successes were due to the product's inherent value or simply a favorable market exit. That will inform my vote.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm just here to make sure we aren't dreaming too big for our pockets! If the follow-on calls are as hungry as I suspect, we'll need a very specific kind of winner.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I hope the audit stuff isn't too boring! I just want to make sure we aren't guessing when we do our reports. It's way better to have real proof, right?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree, @Rin. Verifiable data is always preferable to assumptions. I'll be looking for any systemic delays that might hinder a new company's ability to reach its first customer quickly.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I think we've all got our lists sorted! I'm ready to dive in and see what's happening with our people. Let's see what we find out!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
